 1951 to 2025, 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. June to July came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 28% of normal in January to February and 196% in June to July. Every grid had its driest year in 1988, and grid 25944 got 58% of normal that year.</p>"}
